(189, 'We’re excited to announce that HDesk is launching soon as RSS’s official ticketing system, a smarter, faster, and more efficient way to address your concerns and inquiries.\r\n\r\nGet ready for a smoother support experience and stay tuned for more updates. In the meantime, don’t miss our teaser video and see what’s coming next!', 'Ticketing System on the Way! 🎉', 'Admin', '2026-02-22 16:01:50', '[{\"original\":\"Hdesk_revise.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_699ab7ede941b4.87825833.mp4\"}]', 0),
(190, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 02, 2026.', 'Payroll Feb 16 - 28, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-02 09:23:02', NULL, 0),
